            "review_title": "Review at Aiii House Saigon",
            "review_text": "Thiện T\n12 contributions\n0\nMust try\nApr 2026 • Couples\nA perfect experience at home!!!\n\nThe restaurant features contemporary Vietnamese cuisine. The dishes turned pretty interesting.\n\nCrudo sour, bread served with peanut butter and spirits. It sounds weird, but it's super delicious. \n\nHighly recommend calling Wagyu and Sò. Over well, over well.\n\nSuper cute staff, taking care of you from door to table, from table to door. Very delicate and attentive.\n\nMust try, must try, must try.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 12, 2026",
